            <label for="orderId2" class="mb-1.5 block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-dbs-dark/40 dark:text-white/30">Réf. commande Stripe (optionnel)</label>
            <input type="text" id="orderId2" name="orderId"
